&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Sony Music Entertainment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sony Music Entertainment, we fuel the creative journey. We’ve played a pioneering role in music history, from the first-ever music label to the invention of the flat disc record. We’ve nurtured some of music’s most iconic artists and produced some of the most influential recordings of all time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we work in more than 70 countries, supporting a diverse roster of international superstars, developing and independent artists, and visionary creators. From our position at the intersection of music, entertainment, and technology, we bring imagination and expertise to the newest products and platforms, embrace new business models, employ breakthrough tools, and provide powerful insights that help our artists push creative boundaries and reach new audiences. In everything we do, we&#39;re committed to artistic integrity, transparency, and entrepreneurship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music Entertainment is a member of the Sony family of global companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music’s Product, Design, Engineering and Global Operations (PDEGO) organization is looking for a Senior Software Engineer to join our growing engineering team in our London office. You’ll help build and evolve the platforms that power some of the most critical areas of our global business and support artists, songwriters, labels, and partners around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to solve complex engineering challenges at scale while working closely with product managers, business stakeholders, and cross-functional partners to modernize the systems that support the music industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and enhance scalable applications that support Sony Music’s global products and platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain high-quality software across the full application stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers and business stakeholders to translate complex business requirements into reliable technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, maintainable, and well-tested code with a focus on long-term quality and system reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in architecture discussions, technical design, and modernization initiatives across our platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design APIs and services that integrate with internal systems and third-party platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help improve application performance, observability, scalability, and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior engineers through code reviews, technical guidance, and knowledge sharing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineering leadership to establish engineering best practices and continuously improve development processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot production issues using logs, monitoring, and root-cause analysis to ensure platform stability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional software engineering experience building and maintaining complex software applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing distributed systems and service-oriented architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with Python and JavaScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building frontend applications using TypeScript and React&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with databases and query technologies such as MySQL, Snowflake, Neo4j, Kafka, OpenSearch, or similar platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and consuming RESTful APIs and working with HTTP and OAuth standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working within AWS cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing unit, integration, and automated tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience investigating production issues through logging, monitoring, and performance analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Agile development environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to collaborate across engineering, product, and business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in learning the complexities of the systems and business processes that support the global music industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ideal candidate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building software for financial, accounting, ERP, payments, e-commerce, content, data, or other highly complex and data-intensive business systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience modeling complex business domains and translating business rules into scalable software solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data modeling, schema design, and relational databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience optimizing application performance, database queries, and large-scale data processing&lt;/li&gt;
