&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Build and maintain data pipelines using Python (Dagster) to support Doctolib&#39;s AI strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain data marts in BigQuery using SQL/Jinja, DBT&lt;/li&gt;
